{
    "TEST_NOTES": [
        "Fixture data for tests/unit/module_utils/orchestrators/test_ethernet_routed_interface.py",
        "Response shapes mirror test_ethernet_trunk_host_interface.json (fabric summary -> switches -> per-switch interfaces).",
        "The 00400 interface lists deliberately include system routed policy types (numbered, multiSiteLinkMember, vrfLiteLinkMember)",
        "with configData.mode 'routed' to pin the underlay-safety filter: managed-set membership, not mode, decides scope."
